{"unit_id":"kaminn__dsh-web-fetch-fakeip#card-zh","repo":"kaminn/dsh-web-fetch-fakeip","commit":"0e0d5f63006570be971b49694b1e0afee2f0bc14","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-fetch-fakeip 是一款面向 DSH 的网页抓取兼容插件，适用于 mihomo 或 Clash 的 fake-ip DNS 与 TUN 代理环境。它替换 DSH 的 HTTP 抓取 provider，并沿用原有传输实现，只调整目的地址判定。它可让占位 IP 答案继续完成网页抓取、保留响应与超时限制、支持自定义 fake-ip 网段，并提供 DNS 诊断脚本。适合在透明代理环境中继续使用 DSH web_fetch 的用户。常规默认网段无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:69-80","src/resolver.js:140-168","src/config.js:37-52"]}
{"unit_id":"kaminn__dsh-web-fetch-fakeip#card-en","repo":"kaminn/dsh-web-fetch-fakeip","commit":"0e0d5f63006570be971b49694b1e0afee2f0bc14","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-fetch-fakeip restores DSH web_fetch for fake-IP DNS in mihomo or Clash TUN setups. It replaces the HTTP provider and accepts hostname answers in configured placeholder ranges. Fetch limits are configurable, and a diagnostic script checks DNS coverage. The default range needs no extra setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:69-80","src/resolver.js:140-168","src/config.js:37-52"]}
