{"unit_id":"kaminn__dsh-web-fetch-fakeip#feature-provider","repo":"kaminn/dsh-web-fetch-fakeip","commit":"0e0d5f63006570be971b49694b1e0afee2f0bc14","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-fetch-fakeip 的功能「允许 fake-ip 域名抓取」：将 fake-ip 感知的解析器接入 DSH 的 HTTP fetch provider；域名答案全部位于配置占位网段时继续请求并返回网页响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:69-79","src/resolver.js:140-168"]}
