{"unit_id":"kaminn__dsh-web-fetch-fakeip#feature-limits","repo":"kaminn/dsh-web-fetch-fakeip","commit":"0e0d5f63006570be971b49694b1e0afee2f0bc14","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-fetch-fakeip 的功能「沿用抓取限制」：插件把响应大小、字符数、超时、重定向数和 User-Agent 配置传给 stock HTTP provider，供 DSH 网页抓取使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/config.js:39-52","src/index.js:69-79"]}
